  "body": "You know that feeling when a place just works?\r\n\r\nNot too big. Not too small.\r\nNot a project. Not a compromise.\r\nJust right.\r\n\r\nWelcome to 16 Malvina Place, and Welcome Home.\r\n\r\nSet back, in a quiet cul-de-sac, and properly private, it's the kind of place you come home to and instantly switch off.\r\n\r\nFresh underfoot. Crisp on the walls.\r\nOver time, updated and carries that clean, ready feel from the moment you step inside.\r\n\r\nSun pours in. The living spills out.\r\nDoors open, music on, BBQ going.\r\nFriends around the table. Kids in the pool. Dog doing laps.\r\n\r\nOne-level living keeps things easy. Clean, modern finishes keep things sharp.\r\n\r\nThe deck? Which one..? Take your pick!\r\nMorning coffee, front deck. That's your go-to.\r\nLate drinks & everything in between. Out the back, with the best tunes from your Spotify playlist on repeat.\r\n\r\nThe rear yard, fenced, for peace of mind. Room to move, space to grow, and nothing to hold you back.\r\n\r\nNo distractions. No compromises. Just a home that delivers exactly what you want it to.\r\n\r\nAfter a chapter well enjoyed and a move already in motion, the door is now open for someone new to step in and make it theirs.",
